      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit of a high-level overview. Could you get a bit more specific on the legal mechanics? Specifically, I'd like to see a more rigorous academic treatment of the Living Constitutionalist position—how do scholars in that camp actually justify their methodology through legal theory, rather than just saying it \"evolves\"? I want to see if they have a structured framework equivalent to the historical/textual focus of Originalism.",
